{A soldier walks a dog}

The soldier marched through the empty streets, his dog by his side. The once bustling city was now a ghost town, the only sound being the clinking of the dog's leash as it dragged along the pavement. The soldier's heart heavy with the weight of the world, his thoughts consumed by the failing business he had left behind.

